{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34006","headline":"秋夕文宴得遥字 · 皮日休","name":"秋夕文宴得遥字","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"啼螿衰叶共萧萧，文宴无喧夜转遥。\n高韵最宜题雪赞，逸才偏称和云谣。\n风吹翠蜡应难刻，月照清香太易消。\n无限玄言一杯酒，可能容得盖宽饶。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34006.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34006","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}